WEBVTT

00:00:27.648 --> 00:00:31.444
It's basically 27 degrees Celsius,

00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:33.696
or 80 degrees Fahrenheit,

00:00:33.738 --> 00:00:35.782
every day, all year.

00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:39.327
We get enough rain, but not too much rain.

00:00:39.368 --> 00:00:41.913
We get enough sun, but not too much sun.

00:00:41.913 --> 00:00:43.790
And if you were to live there,

00:00:43.831 --> 00:00:48.711
you don't necessarily have to turn
your heater on in the winter,

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:52.799
or you don't have to turn
your air conditioning on in the summer.

00:00:53.132 --> 00:00:56.260
So I grew up in this paradise

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.514
until I had to leave home

00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:03.726
to attain a modern education
away from my home.